{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1795417330316,"sessionID":"ses_df8c9bef4ffe9bYfe1meoe3gzj","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"skill","callID":"call_dde1973016c641b6bf90b651","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"name":"agent-lib-snaps"},"output":"<skill_content name=\"agent-lib-snaps\">\n# Skill: agent-lib-snaps\n\n# Read-only snapshot tools (agent-lib)\n\nRun the matching command FIRST, before separate git, gh or systemctl calls; each replaces several calls with one bounded call.\n\n- Repository state or worktrees: `[HOME]/work/agent-lib/bin/git-snap [repo] [--worktrees]` (branch, ahead/behind, status, branches, recent commits; `--worktrees` lists every worktree with branch and dirty state).\n- Reviewing uncommitted changes (what changed, staged vs unstaged, whitespace errors): `[HOME]/work/agent-lib/bin/change-snap [repo] [--base REF]`\n- Pull request or branch status (mergeable, review decision, CI checks, changed files): `[HOME]/work/agent-lib/bin/pr-snap [repo] <pr-number|branch>` (uses `gh` read-only)\n- Which tests relate to changed (or given) files, and what test functions they define: `[HOME]/work/agent-lib/bin/test-map-snap [repo] [--files a,b]`\n\nBase directory for this skill: [HOME]/.agents/skills/agent-lib-snaps\nRelative paths in this skill (e.g., scripts/, reference/) are relative to this base directory.\nNote: file list is sampled.\n\n<skill_files>\n\n</skill_files>\n</skill_content>","metadata":{"name":"agent-lib-snaps","dir":"[HOME]/.agents/skills/agent-lib-snaps","truncated":false},"title":"Loaded skill: agent-lib-snaps","time":{"start":1795417330292,"end":1795417330313}},"id":"prt_2073651ad001Uc9CH6e3e89eMh","sessionID":"ses_df8c9bef4ffe9bYfe1meoe3gzj","messageID":"msg_207364374001BVzTBJ37gDQYPS"}}
